3:["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":["This is not a traffic quality problem. It is an audience-page alignment problem. The LinkedIn audience is often ",["$","em",null,{"children":"higher quality"}]," - but higher quality buyers require higher quality proof, and most landing pages were not built to deliver it."]}]
4:["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-xl font-semibold text-fg","children":"What LinkedIn Traffic Actually Scrutinises"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"B2B buyers arriving from LinkedIn run a rapid credibility checklist that most pages fail silently. Understanding what they are looking for - and in what order - is the first step to fixing the gap."}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mb-4 space-y-3 text-fg-muted","children":[["$","li",null,{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-1 text-accent","children":"→"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Founder and company credentials."}]," Who built this? What gives them the authority to solve this problem? LinkedIn users are accustomed to profiles - they instinctively look for signals of domain expertise. Anonymous brands with no named team score low."]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-1 text-accent","children":"→"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Specific, attributable results."}]," \"We helped companies grow\" is invisible. \"We reduced Acme Corp's cost-per-hire by 34% in 90 days\" is credible. The specificity signals that the claim is real and verifiable."]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-1 text-accent","children":"→"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Professional register."}]," Casual, consumer-grade copy reads as amateurish to a senior buyer. This does not mean formal or stiff - it means precise, confident, and free of hype language."]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-1 text-accent","children":"→"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Peer-group relevance."}]," Do the logos, case studies, and job-title references match this buyer's world? A VP of Engineering needs to see engineering leaders, not generic SME testimonials."]}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"If any of these four signals are absent or weak, the LinkedIn visitor bounces - not because the offer is wrong, but because the page failed the credibility audit they ran in the first 15 seconds."}]]}]
5:["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-xl font-semibold text-fg","children":"The CPL Inflation Trap"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":["LinkedIn CPCs typically run 3–5× higher than Facebook for comparable B2B audiences. That premium is justified ",["$","em",null,{"children":"only"}]," if your conversion rate holds up. The economics collapse faster than most advertisers realise."]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-4 rounded-xl bg-bg p-5","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-2 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-fg-muted","children":"Illustrative CPL comparison"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"overflow-x-auto","children":["$","table",null,{"className":"w-full text-sm text-fg-muted","children":[["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"className":"border-b border-border text-left","children":[["$","th",null,{"className":"pb-2 font-semibold text-fg","children":"Channel"}],["$","th",null,{"className":"pb-2 font-semibold text-fg","children":"CPC"}],["$","th",null,{"className":"pb-2 font-semibold text-fg","children":"CVR"}],["$","th",null,{"className":"pb-2 font-semibold text-fg","children":"CPL"}]]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr",null,{"className":"border-b border-border/50","children":[["$","td",null,{"className":"py-2","children":"Facebook"}],["$","td",null,{"className":"py-2","children":"$$4"}],["$","td",null,{"className":"py-2","children":"2.0%"}],["$","td",null,{"className":"py-2","children":"$$200"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"className":"py-2","children":"LinkedIn (same page)"}],["$","td",null,{"className":"py-2","children":"$$16"}],["$","td",null,{"className":"py-2","children":"0.5%"}],["$","td",null,{"className":"py-2","children":"$$3,200"}]]}]]}]]}]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"A 4× CPC increase combined with a 4× conversion rate drop produces a 16× CPL difference. At that ratio, no amount of lead quality justification closes the economics gap. The page is the problem - not the channel, the audience, or the offer."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"The common mistake is attributing poor LinkedIn performance to audience intent and pulling spend. The correct diagnosis is that the page was never built for a professional credibility-first audience."}]]}]
6:["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-xl font-semibold text-fg","children":"The B2B Proof Hierarchy"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Not all social proof is equal to a LinkedIn audience. There is a strict hierarchy of credibility signals, and most pages are heavy on the bottom tiers while the top tiers - which actually move senior buyers - are absent."}],["$","ol",null,{"className":"mb-4 space-y-3 text-fg-muted","children":[["$","li",null,{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent text-xs font-bold text-white","children":"1"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Named enterprise customers."}]," \"Used by teams at Salesforce, HubSpot, and Workday\" - with permission and logos - is the highest signal. Peer companies create immediate social permission."]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent text-xs font-bold text-white","children":"2"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Specific ROI metrics."}]," Numbers with attribution (\"reduced onboarding time by 40%\") beat directional claims (\"saves time\") by a large margin with analytical buyers."]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent text-xs font-bold text-white","children":"3"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Analyst recognition."}]," G2 Leader badges, Gartner mentions, Forrester citations - independent third-party validation from sources the buyer already trusts."]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent text-xs font-bold text-white","children":"4"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Credentials."}]," Founder background, team expertise, years in the domain. Establishes that the people behind the product know what they are doing."]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent text-xs font-bold text-white","children":"5"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Logos without context."}]," A logo strip with no accompanying data or quote is weak signal - but still better than nothing."]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent/40 text-xs font-bold text-fg-muted","children":"6"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Generic testimonials."}]," \"Great product, highly recommend!\" from an anonymous user adds almost no credibility with a senior B2B buyer."]}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Audit your page against this hierarchy. If your proof stack is bottom-heavy, LinkedIn spend will underperform regardless of how good your targeting is."}]]}]
7:["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-xl font-semibold text-fg","children":"The Form Length Paradox"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"The conventional wisdom - shorter forms convert better - breaks down for LinkedIn audiences when credibility has been established. Senior B2B buyers are accustomed to qualification processes. They do not object to a five-field form. They object to being asked for commitment before trust has been earned."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"The variable that matters is not field count - it is sequence. If a visitor reaches the form having been convinced of your credibility, specificity of results, and peer-group relevance, they will complete a longer form without friction. If they reach the form unconvinced, even a single-field email capture will feel like an overstep."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-4 rounded-xl bg-bg p-5","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-3 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-fg-muted","children":"Page sequence that works for LinkedIn"}],["$","ol",null,{"className":"space-y-2 text-sm text-fg-muted","children":[["$","li",null,{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"1."}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Hero: specific outcome claim with named proof (not a generic value statement)"}]]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"2."}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Credibility block: company logos or case study metrics before any pitch"}]]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"3."}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Problem articulation: demonstrate you understand their specific situation"}]]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"4."}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Solution with mechanism: ",["$","em",null,{"children":"how"}]," you produce the result, not just what it is"]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"5."}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Detailed proof: full case study excerpt or named ROI metrics"}]]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"6."}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Form: now the visitor is ready and motivated to complete it"}]]}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Sequence beats field count. A well-sequenced page with six form fields will outconvert a poorly-sequenced page with one field, because the buyer arrives at the form in a different psychological state."}]]}]
8:["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-xl font-semibold text-fg","children":"Specific Checks Before Scaling LinkedIn Spend"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Run this checklist before increasing LinkedIn budget. Each item represents a common failure point that hurts LinkedIn conversion rates independently of traffic quality."}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"space-y-4 text-fg-muted","children":[["$","li",null,{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-0.5 text-accent","children":"✓"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Named founder or team visible above the fold."}]," ","Anonymous brands do not pass the LinkedIn credibility filter. Add a name, a title, and a credential within the first scroll."]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-0.5 text-accent","children":"✓"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"At least one specific metric with attribution."}]," ","\"X% improvement for [Company type] in [timeframe]\" in the hero or within the first proof block."]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-0.5 text-accent","children":"✓"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Job-title match in testimonials."}]," The titles in your social proof should reflect the audience you are targeting. VPs need to see VP-level peers."]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-0.5 text-accent","children":"✓"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Professional register audit."}]," Read your copy aloud as a senior buyer. Remove hype language (\"revolutionary,\" \"game-changing\"), vague superlatives, and consumer-grade phrasing."]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-0.5 text-accent","children":"✓"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Proof before CTA."}]," If your primary CTA appears before any credibility signal, move it. LinkedIn audiences will not act before they are convinced."]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-0.5 text-accent","children":"✓"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"LinkedIn-specific variant, not the Facebook page."}]," ","If you are sending LinkedIn traffic to the same page as Facebook traffic, you are spending LinkedIn CPCs to reach a credibility-first audience with a scroll-stop-optimised page. Build a separate variant or dedicated landing page."]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-0.5 text-accent","children":"✓"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Mobile parity check."}]," A large share of LinkedIn browsing is mobile. Ensure your credibility signals - logos, metrics, named testimonials - are prominent and legible at mobile viewport, not buried below the fold."]}]]}]]}]]}]
